OL,3,AV&A workers to strike over pay and
OL,4,Aconditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers at three Victoria and Albert
OL,7,Fmuseum sites in London will strike next
OL,8,Fmonth over pay, health and safety, and
OL,9,Fworking conditions.
OL,11,FPublic and Commercial Services (PCS)
OL,12,Funion members at V&A East Storehouse,
OL,13,FV&A East and Young V&A are due to walk
OL,14,Fout on 4 and 5 September.
OL,16,FFrom 4 September onwards, PCS members
OL,17,Fat all sites will work to rule and
OL,18,Fwithdraw cooperation in coordinated
OL,19,Faction with Prospect, another trade
OL,20,Funion, PCS said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
