OL,3,AV&A workers to strike over pay and
OL,4,Aconditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA V&A spokesperson said the museum had
OL,7,Fbeen negotiating with the unions since
OL,8,FFebruary and had met the majority of
OL,9,Ftheir demands with "a significantly
OL,10,Fimproved offer".
